# TVI-WO-0100b gate clause 6 (RUL-17): every field outside SPI's allow-list, written with a value the
# model does not implement, one per case, from reset; each must refuse with TVI-SPI-FIELD, kind
# unmodeled, naming the field. Generated from the RM0433 Rev 9 field list and the ruled allow-list
# (TVI-WO-0100b.rm0433.md §2, §4); the `# FIELD` lines are the expected refusals, in order.
include @/repo/scripts/prelude.resc
# FIELD SPI_CR1.Res31_17
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x40013000 0x00020000
machine Reset
# FIELD SPI_CR1.TCRCINI
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x40013000 0x00008000
machine Reset
# FIELD SPI_CR1.RCRCINI
sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x40013000 0x00004000
machine Reset
